{"id":"parada","lemma":"parada","pos":"noun","rank":1554,"glosses":["stop (the act of stopping)","station (a location where things stop)","(football) stop, (baseball) catch"],"ipa":"/paˈɾada/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"paradas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b3/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-parada.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Dónde está la parada del autobús?","en":"Where's the bus stop?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453487","words":[null,null,{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of the"},{"g":"bus, coach"}],"phrases":[[0,2,"where are you?"]]},{"text":"Esta es tu parada.","en":"This is your stop.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/799452","words":[{"g":"this","l":"este"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"your"},null]},{"text":"¿Cuál es la próxima parada?","en":"What is the next stop?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/80657","words":[{"g":"which one, what, which"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"near","l":"próximo"},null]},{"text":"¿Creo que esa era nuestra parada?","en":"I think that was our stop.","words":[{"g":"to believe","l":"creer"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"that","l":"ese"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"our, ours, to us","l":"nuestro"},null]},{"text":"Ésa es la parada de autobús.","en":"That is the bus stop.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/40102","words":[{"g":"that one","l":"ése"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"bus, coach"}]}]}